    "name": "Chicken Craft",
    "steam_appid": 3343910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2e59490f717f05f2944fc1dae360c138.poster.avif?t=1755085335\" width=727 height=261 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2e59490f717f05f2944fc1dae360c138.webm?t=1755085335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/026c6c96809d991f697eecda8a8d89bc.avif?t=1755085335\" width=622 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic chickens and breed them to discover new appearances, mutations, and hidden DNA traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/b225202a341cd341bd23d2fd57df45d2.poster.avif?t=1755085335\" width=800 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/b225202a341cd341bd23d2fd57df45d2.webm?t=1755085335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/aebe4d1e92b42cdaf23807b7faeb63d1.avif?t=1755085335\" width=622 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay eggs, hatch chicks, and influence their traits using feed and potions. Guide their growth to shape your dream chicken.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2464570834e378aae23b84c6eb2056f9.poster.avif?t=1755085335\" width=800 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2464570834e378aae23b84c6eb2056f9.webm?t=1755085335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/349f731e4247c6377318278b1e518320.avif?t=1755085335\" width=622 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the alchemy table to create potions that manipulate traits and enhance your breeding strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/5df753331e1001516845ae5505696a6a.poster.avif?t=1755085335\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/5df753331e1001516845ae5505696a6a.webm?t=1755085335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2e59490f717f05f2944fc1dae360c138.poster.avif?t=1755085335\" width=727 height=261 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2e59490f717f05f2944fc1dae360c138.webm?t=1755085335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/026c6c96809d991f697eecda8a8d89bc.avif?t=1755085335\" width=622 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic chickens and breed them to discover new appearances, mutations, and hidden DNA traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/b225202a341cd341bd23d2fd57df45d2.poster.avif?t=1755085335\" width=800 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/b225202a341cd341bd23d2fd57df45d2.webm?t=1755085335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/aebe4d1e92b42cdaf23807b7faeb63d1.avif?t=1755085335\" width=622 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay eggs, hatch chicks, and influence their traits using feed and potions. Guide their growth to shape your dream chicken.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2464570834e378aae23b84c6eb2056f9.poster.avif?t=1755085335\" width=800 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/2464570834e378aae23b84c6eb2056f9.webm?t=1755085335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/349f731e4247c6377318278b1e518320.avif?t=1755085335\" width=622 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the alchemy table to create potions that manipulate traits and enhance your breeding strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/5df753331e1001516845ae5505696a6a.poster.avif?t=1755085335\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/5df753331e1001516845ae5505696a6a.webm?t=1755085335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
